<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμα</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Alc.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			4.21
		</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
			<u>Lyr.Alex.Adesp.</u>
			9
		</span></i> (pl.); Cret. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝῆμα</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
			3.38
		</span></i> (but gen. fem. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝήμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.40
				</span></i>
			): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕννυμι</span>):
				—<i>garment</i>, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾶρός τε χιτῶνά τε εἵματ᾽ ἔθηκαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.214
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαῖνάν τε χιτῶνά τε εἵματα ἕσσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.542
				</span></i>
			: in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> mostly, <i>over-garment</i>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				1.155
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.81
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				81
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1268
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγῶνα γυμνικόν ἐν εἵμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					112.91
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rug, carpet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				921
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				963
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1145
			</span></i>.</div>
